    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slide. Merge. Conquer the grid.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Number Merge Mania</strong> is a smart and satisfying puzzle game where your brain is the key to victory. Slide numbered blocks across the board \u2014 but choose your moves wisely! Each block has a limited number of steps, and once it stops, it locks in place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? <strong>Fill every empty space</strong> on the board using logic, foresight, and clever planning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Gameplay Highlights:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Strategic Movement</strong> \u2013 Blocks move in the direction you swipe, but each has a limited range. Plan ahead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Grid-Filling Challenge</strong> \u2013 Fill every square on the board to complete the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Progressive Difficulty</strong> \u2013 Levels get tougher as you advance. Can you outsmart every puzzle?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Minimalist Visuals, Maximum Brainpower</strong> \u2013 Clean design with a focus on gameplay clarity and logic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love brain teasers, spatial puzzles, and games that reward smart thinking, <strong>Number Merge Mania</strong> will keep you hooked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you master the grid and complete every stage?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slide. Merge. Conquer the grid.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Number Merge Mania</strong> is a smart and satisfying puzzle game where your brain is the key to victory. Slide numbered blocks across the board \u2014 but choose your moves wisely! Each block has a limited number of steps, and once it stops, it locks in place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? <strong>Fill every empty space</strong> on the board using logic, foresight, and clever planning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Gameplay Highlights:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Strategic Movement</strong> \u2013 Blocks move in the direction you swipe, but each has a limited range. Plan ahead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Grid-Filling Challenge</strong> \u2013 Fill every square on the board to complete the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Progressive Difficulty</strong> \u2013 Levels get tougher as you advance. Can you outsmart every puzzle?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Minimalist Visuals, Maximum Brainpower</strong> \u2013 Clean design with a focus on gameplay clarity and logic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love brain teasers, spatial puzzles, and games that reward smart thinking, <strong>Number Merge Mania</strong> will keep you hooked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you master the grid and complete every stage?</strong></p>",
